*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.db binary
*.sqlite binary
*.sqlite3 binary
*.pmcbackup binary
